Conclusion
The practical demonstrates the implementation of both Autoencoder and Variational Autoencoder models for image reconstruction using MNIST.
The Autoencoder learns an efficient deterministic representation for reconstruction, while the VAE learns a probabilistic and more structured latent space that enables new image generation.
The comparison demonstrates the difference between reconstruction-focused representation learning and probabilistic generative representation learning.
